haami-laai cha nigaah
khrisT-ko rakta-le shuru bhai
haami-le paayauň chyemaa.', '2024-12-17 12:12:22.177956'),
('b414', 'susamaacaar failaau he bhaai-bahini ho', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/susamaacaar failaau he bhaai-bahini ho - b414.html', '

Chorus:
