maile vishwaas un-maa raakheň
ani uddhaar maile paayeň
unko jhanDi-muni aayeň,
ma yeshu-ko huň.', '2024-12-17 12:12:24.883807'),
('b417', 'gharghar ghumera prabhu-laai pracaar', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/gharghar ghumera prabhu-laai pracaar - b417.html', '

