('b450', 'parmeshwor, jasle prithivi ra tribhuvan (god who made the earth)', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/parmeshwor, jasle prithivi ra tribhuvan (god who made the earth) - b450.html', '

Verse 1:
