असाध्य अनुग्रह दान दिनोस्‌।
yes saataa-kaa (barsa) sab paap aparaadh
he ishwor maaf garnos
Thik dharma garnucha,
asaadhye anugraha daan dinos.', '2024-12-17 12:13:12.209062'),
('b467', 'arpan gardachaun yo bhabanlaai prabhu ishworlaai', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/arpan gardachaun yo bhabanlaai prabhu ishworlaai - b467.html', '

