yo haami maagdachauň.', '2024-12-17 12:08:34.301873'),
('c149', 'bijai cha mero khristmaa (victory i have in jesus christ)', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/bijai cha mero khristmaa (victory i have in jesus christ) - c149 -mp3.html', '

विजयता छ मेरो ख्रीष्टमा
