prabhu bishwaas-yogye chan pratigyaa puraa garna-laai.', '2024-12-17 12:18:37.977589'),
('b716', 'maatoko mero chyenbhangur sharirlaai', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/maatoko mero chyenbhangur sharirlaai - b716.html', '

Chorus:
