('b773', '''ridai deu'' maagchan param-prabhu (give me thy heart)', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/''ridai deu'' maagchan param-prabhu (give me thy heart) - b773 -mp3.html', '

