sabai bojh haTaai
shaanti milos.', '2024-12-17 12:21:19.161375'),
('b822', 'aaraadhanaa garchaun haami', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/aaraadhanaa garchaun haami - b822.html', '

Chorus:
