2', '2024-12-17 12:21:21.099765'),
('b823', 'yeshu tapaainlaai yo mero jivan', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/yeshu tapaainlaai yo mero jivan - b823.html', '

Chorus:
