2

', '2024-12-17 12:21:22.743251'),
('b824', 'maanchelaai hoina yeshulaai hera', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/maanchelaai hoina yeshulaai hera - b824 -mp3.html', '

