('b732', 'aashaa cha prabhumaa jo praan aafno diye (my hope is in the lord)', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/aashaa cha prabhumaa jo praan aafno diye (my hope is in the lord) - b732.html', '

Verse 1:
आशा छ प्रभुमा जो प्राण आफ्नो दिए
