('b083', 'yeshu bardaan-ko mul-dhaaraa (come thou fount)', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/yeshu bardaan-ko mul-dhaaraa (come thou fount) - b083 -mp3.html', '

Verse 1:
