sworgiye amar prem-laai
aaja ani yesai
ghaDi maaga paun-laai.', '2024-12-17 12:09:24.373106'),
('b225', 'ek din jagatlaai chodnucha', 'https://www.nepalichristiansongs.net/songs/lyrics/nepali/ek din jagatlaai chodnucha - b225.html', '

