प्रभु येशू ख्रीष्ट बलि भाको ।
kalvari DaaňDaa-ko, puraano krus kaaTh-ko
kasTa ra sharma-ko pratik tyo
jahaaň haraa-yekaa paapi-ko laagi nai
prabhu yeshu khrisT bali bhaa-ko.


Chorus:
