pyaaro garchu ma tyo krusa-laai
[yeshu-ko tyo krus-laai]
bijai upahaar caRhaaunaa-laai
angaalne-chu ma tyo krusa-laai [yeshu-ko tyo krus-laai]
kunai din tyo mukuT paauna-laai.


Verse 2:
